    the CI workflow's effectively-loading ruleset (rulesets/java/quickstart.xml
    — the workflow's errorprone/bestpractices references are PMD 6 deprecated
    aliases that do not resolve in PMD 7.4.0 and never loaded; verified with
    the same PMD version, rule-by-rule distribution identical) minus
    ControlStatementBraces, the project's documented dense-guard style
    convention (~194 full-tree instances; rationale in the file header and
